# ========================================================================================
#  Enterprise Wallet Bot - Single File Build (Fixed Minimal Edition)
#  CHUNK D: Admin Users Detail (transactions + wallet ops), Channels Stats UI, Logs Viewer
#  Notes:
#    - No refactor; uses existing endpoints and adds UI pages + small helper routes
#    - Introduces simple in-memory ring buffer logger for /admin/logs (optional)
